# {{ name }}

Applet id: `{{ id }}`.

Requires Python 3.14 and `uv`. `uv` installs the `glimpse-applet-sdk` dependency on first run.

Run `glimpsectl applet run --dev .`: it loads `config.toml` and attaches the
applet with its options and env. Options edits update it; source
edits restart it. Run `uv run mypy` to type-check it in strict mode. The desktop entry runs `uv run applet.py`.

Add `center = ["{{ id }}"]` to a panel's applet zone.
